      <title>Trump’s “Little War” With Iran Just Got Bigger Because of the Houthis</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-14/trump-s-little-war-with-iran-just-got-bigger-because-of-the-houthis</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3ca38585c036ad0f69042ce8</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 04:01:06 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>It is an unintended feature of President Donald Trump’s Plan B for defeating Iran — economic strangulation — that the more successful the policy becomes, the more risk the men who run the Islamic Republic are willing to accept to fight it. Judged on that metric, the American blockade and sanctions are working, but they’re also raising the stakes beyond what the US is willing to pay.</description>
